### === Workflow Forms Engine Demo ===
### This demonstrates the complete lifecycle of the Information Request workflow
### Prerequisites: MockBackOffice running on port 5163, TestSite running on port 5001

@mockBackOfficeUrl = http://localhost:5163
@testSiteUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### ============================================================================
### STEP 1: Create a new workflow instance
### ============================================================================

# @name createInstance
POST {{testSiteUrl}}/umbraco/prism/workflow/instances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "definitionKey": "information-request",
  "correlationId": "demo-001"
}

###
@instanceId = {{createInstance.response.body.instanceId}}

### ============================================================================
### STEP 2: Get current state (should be "collecting-info", archetype: Collect)
### ============================================================================

# @name getCurrentState
GET {{testSiteUrl}}/umbraco/prism/workflow/instances/{{instanceId}}

###

### ============================================================================
### STEP 3: Submit form data (transition from collecting-info to under-review)
### ============================================================================

# @name submitForm
POST {{testSiteUrl}}/umbraco/prism/workflow/instances/{{instanceId}}/advance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "submit",
  "expectedStateVersion": 1,
  "fieldValues": {
    "firstName": "Alice",
    "lastName": "Smith",
    "dateOfBirth": "1985-03-12",
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "requestType": "General enquiry",
    "description": "I would like to understand more about your services and how they can help my organization with data compliance requirements.",
    "urgency": "Standard (5-7 working days)"
  }
}

###

### ============================================================================
### STEP 4: Check state after submission (should be "under-review", archetype: StatusTimeline)
### ============================================================================

# @name checkReviewState
GET {{testSiteUrl}}/umbraco/prism/workflow/instances/{{instanceId}}

###

### ============================================================================
### STEP 5: Approve as reviewer (via MockBackOffice emulator)
### This simulates a backoffice reviewer taking action on the request
### ============================================================================

# @name approveAsReviewer
POST {{mockBackOfficeUrl}}/emulator/workflow/instances/{{instanceId}}/advance-as-reviewer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "approve"
}

###

### ============================================================================
### STEP 6: Check final state (should be "complete", archetype: Completion)
### ============================================================================

# @name checkFinalState
GET {{testSiteUrl}}/umbraco/prism/workflow/instances/{{instanceId}}

###

### ============================================================================
### ALTERNATIVE PATH: Request changes instead of approving
### ============================================================================

### First, create a new instance for the alternative flow
# @name createInstance2
POST {{testSiteUrl}}/umbraco/prism/workflow/instances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "definitionKey": "information-request",
  "correlationId": "demo-002"
}

###
@instanceId2 = {{createInstance2.response.body.instanceId}}

### Submit the form
# @name submitForm2
POST {{testSiteUrl}}/umbraco/prism/workflow/instances/{{instanceId2}}/advance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "submit",
  "expectedStateVersion": 1,
  "fieldValues": {
    "firstName": "Bob",
    "lastName": "Johnson",
    "dateOfBirth": "1990-07-22",
    "email": "bob@example.com",
    "requestType": "Technical support",
    "description": "Need help with integration.",
    "urgency": "Urgent (2 working days)"
  }
}

###

### Request changes (reviewer sends it back to collecting-info)
# @name requestChanges
POST {{mockBackOfficeUrl}}/emulator/workflow/instances/{{instanceId2}}/advance-as-reviewer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "request-changes"
}

###

### Check state (should be back to "collecting-info")
# @name checkChangesRequested
GET {{testSiteUrl}}/umbraco/prism/workflow/instances/{{instanceId2}}

###

### ============================================================================
### EMULATOR-ONLY ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================

### List all active workflow instances in the emulator
GET {{mockBackOfficeUrl}}/emulator/workflow/instances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get workflow definitions (proxy to Umbraco API)
GET {{mockBackOfficeUrl}}/emulator/workflow/definitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
